  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of South Sudan HIV Programme Strategic Plan (PSP).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is designed to facilitate the establishment of necessary strategies and systems to enhance SCBRS HIV department to be able to shift its current HIV program to move from project-based to programme-based planning and implementation, and to offer strategic guidance to the dioceses in the implementation of HIV work

This is intended to be achieved by ensuring SCBRS ability to develop an HIV Programme Strategic Plan with clear partnership strategy for increased networking and advocacy and a resource mobilization strategy for increased and diversified funding. The project primarily targets SCBRS as an institution and the dioceses located in the southern part of Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
